title    Auld Lang Syne
composer Traditional (Scotland), arranged for steel disc
about    Lanterns glimmer as the old year turns. The tune returns.
tempo    84
beats    3
steps    2
swing    0
reverb   0.38

voice lead musicbox vol=0.88 pan=-0.08 rev=0.42 bright=0.82
voice bell bell vol=0.27 pan=0.2 rev=0.44 gate=0.8
voice bass harp vol=0.3 pan=0 rev=0.3

pattern intro
lead | G4-- D5-- | G5-- A5-- |
bell | [G]----- | [D]----- |
bass | G2----- | D2----- |

pattern A
lead | G4- G4- B4- | B4- A4- B4- |
lead | A4- B4- D5- | D5- E5- D5- |
lead | B4- B4- A4- | A4- G4- G4- |
lead | E5- D5- B4- | A4- G4- G4- |
bell | [G]-- [G]-- | [D]-- [G]-- | [D]-- [G]-- | [C]-- [D]-- |
bell | [G]-- [G]-- | [D]-- [G]-- | [C]-- [G]-- | [D]----- |
